# Docker context for apps/rt4d-engine/Dockerfile (context = mrs/)
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.git
**/.turbo
**/.cache
**/cdk.out
**/*.md
!packages/renderer-core/README.md

# Keep only packages needed for rt4d-engine image
apps/*
!apps/rt4d-engine
packages/*
!packages/renderer-core

# Large / unrelated trees
tmp
docs
test-results
**/.codex-plugin
**/widget/node_modules
